<p class="lead">
	Grid for two-dimensional layouts and vertical stacks; flex for one-dimensional rows that wrap. Spacing between
	siblings comes from <code>gap</code>. Primitives live in <code>src/styles/layout.css</code> with zero specificity, so
	component styles always win.
</p>

